  "description": {
    "en": "Babolat Touch VS is one of the world's benchmark natural gut tennis strings. Made in France from natural collagen fibres, it offers exceptional elasticity, power, comfort and feel while maintaining tension better than almost any other string type. Its long ball-contact time produces a uniquely connected response, and its tension stability makes it especially valuable in professional and hybrid string setups.",

    "zh": "Babolat Touch VS 是全球天然肠线领域最具代表性的产品之一，法国制造，以天然胶原纤维制成。它拥有极高弹性、强劲力量、顶级舒适性和极佳击球反馈，同时具备非常出色的保磅能力。由于球线与球接触时间更长，Touch VS 能提供非常细腻、直接的手感，并且特别适合与聚酯线组成混合穿线方案。"
  },

